OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoy died after leaping from
OL,4,Awindow, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has concluded that a
OL,7,Ffive-year-old boy died after he leapt
OL,8,Ffrom the 15th floor of a tower in the
OL,9,Fbelief he could fly, owing to his
OL,10,Fautism and inability to assess risk.
OL,12,FAalim Ahmed died instantly when he fell
OL,13,Ffrom a kitchen window, which could tilt
OL,14,Fand turn, at a residential block in
OL,15,FPlaistow, east London, on 16 May 2024.
OL,17,FContrasting accounts about the
OL,18,Fcondition of the windows were heard at
OL,19,Fthe inquest into the boy's death.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
