OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoy died after leaping from
OL,4,Awindow, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelivering a narrative conclusion,
OL,7,Fassistant coroner Ian Wade said that
OL,8,Fwhile the window was "compromised",
OL,9,Fthere was "no compelling reason why a
OL,10,Flandlord should've considered that
OL,11,Fplacing this little boy on the 15th
OL,12,Ffloor was inappropriate".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
